ListHeaderRenderer":{"title":{"runs":[{"text":"oilyFoot65 tagged products below."},{"text":" "},{"text":"Learn more","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CB0Qw9AHGAAiEwisyOPovsuTAxV52TwCHa7XOaDKAQTEkR5A","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"#"}},"openPopupAction":{"popup":{"menuPopupRenderer":{"items":[{"menuServiceItemRenderer":{"text":{"accessibility":{"accessibilityData":{"label":"About products and commissions"}},"simpleText":"About products and commissions"},"icon":{"iconType":"HELP"},"serviceEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CB0Qw9AHGAAiEwisyOPovsuTAxV52TwCHa7XOaDKAQTEkR5A","openPopupAction":{"popup":{"fancyDismissibleDialogRenderer":{"dialogMessage":{"runs":[{"text":"Product(s) listed here are based on products mentioned in the video that you are watching, Shopping collections or from your past activity while signed in to YouTube, including product(s) that you've searched for, products mentioned in video(s) or related product(s). ","textColor":4279440147},{"text":"Learn more","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CFsQx1UiEwisyOPovsuTAxV52TwCHa7XOaDKAQTEkR5A","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/12257682?nohelpkit=1","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/12257682?nohelpkit=1","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}},{"text":"\n\nProduct information and final pricing are determined by merchants and may change. You may be charged additional fees, such as delivery and handling fees, which may vary. Click on the products below or visit the merchant's shop for more information, including product availability and the final price that you will be charged by the merchant, and to make a purchase. Prices include VAT where applicable.\n\nProducts marked as 'channel exclusive' are listings that a merchant has shared exclusively with a specific YouTube channel. These products are discounted and/or time limited subject to the